<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: A supernatural psychic phenomena is happening over this entire region. Psychic energy will strike in random locations, damaging whatever is hit. Psychic sensitivity of everyone affected is doubled.-->
  <VREA_PsychicStorm.description>整个地区正在发生超自然的灵异现象。精神能量会攻击随机位置，对被击中的物体造成伤害。每个受影响的人的心灵敏感度都会加倍。</VREA_PsychicStorm.description>
  <!--EN: The psychic storm is ending.-->
  <VREA_PsychicStorm.endMessage>心灵风暴即将结束。</VREA_PsychicStorm.endMessage>
  <!--EN: psychic storm-->
  <VREA_PsychicStorm.label>心灵风暴</VREA_PsychicStorm.label>
  <!--EN: A supernatural psychic phenomena causes a great disturbance in the area.\n\nPsychic energy will strike at random, and every living being will have their psychic sensitivity doubled.\n\nIt will last for anywhere between a few days to over a quadrum.-->
  <VREA_PsychicStorm.letterText>超自然的灵能现象会在该地区引起巨大的骚乱。

灵能会随机袭来，所有生物的灵能敏感度都会加倍。

持续时间从几天到超过四分之一。</VREA_PsychicStorm.letterText>
</LanguageData>
